  "notes": "Dark near-black (#181818) IDE-like UI with surfaces distinguished only by one-step-lighter fills (#202020) and 12px radii — no shadows, almost no borders except inset status rows and outlined toolbar buttons. Cards pack a lot: title + play + ⋮, 2-line clamped prompt description, pill chips (repo folder icon, schedule clock, trigger), a micro run-history strip of thin vertical bars coloured by outcome, a bordered 'latest run' row (Pending clock / Running spinner / Successful green check / Failed red x) with live step text and relative time, then a 3-column term/definition stats footer. Inactive cards have disabled play buttons. Group-by-status headings carry count pills. Command palette (Ctrl+K) is a centered overlay with sectioned Navigation/Settings results and GO key hints. Filters live in a toolbar popover with select dropdowns for status/trigger/tag plus sort."
}
